Id: crt001f
Severity: FAIL
Category: services
Check: check_certs
Fix: Renew the certificate before clients refuse it.
References: openssl-x509(1)
Controls: CIS 3.10; NIST SC-12, SC-17; ISO 8.24

A certificate this server presents (its web server's, or one kept in
the usual places) has expired. Clients that check dates refuse it, so
the service is down for them; clients that do not check are open to
anyone with another certificate for the name.
